    {
      "id": "claim_49952a4605264db5a807b3d3e7eedd2f",
      "statement": "In the v1 wiring the engine wraps rule.apply in try/except and records an ev_reject trace event with reason 'relation error: ...' when the relation raises, but the scripted (None, note) branch does not raise and the note is discarded by the engine's _note unpacking, so a None-valued derived fact can never satisfy the deduction known-fact scan or resolve a numeric answer; the solver's structured note is not threaded into the trace as a rejection reason.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://engine.py#L122-L126",
