      "id": "claim_d40d210e6c234be194420a29141724fd",
      "statement": "The SOLVERS registry maps hook tokens to callables of shape (relation, given, target) -> (value, note); exactly one backend is registered in v1, 'sympy.algebra' -> solve_symbolic, and z3.sat or custom hooks exist only as ARCHITECTURE conceptual possibilities, not shipped code.",
