      "id": "claim_4c393d646fb440c5a36731964e8a9d27",
      "statement": "get_solver(hook) returns the registered callable or raises ValueError('unknown solver hook ...; known: [...]') listing the registered tokens; since every physics rule declares solver_hook='sympy.algebra' and the relation closure resolves the token at rule-firing time, an unregistered hook fails loudly with no silent fallback.",
